          "author": "Ellie Baker",
          "description": "This free digital card was made by an Independent Creator and published on Yoto Space. Visit Open Mic on Yoto Space to discover more great free titles!  \n\nCreator: Ellie Baker  \n\nFrom the Creator: “Join Clara and her Dream Dragon Nimbus, as they soar through the night sky looking for dreamers in need of help. When the Dream Patrol are about, every nightmare will be turned into a wonderful dream. Tonight, Clara and Nimbus come across Miles, a boy who has lost his toy cat Whiskers. Can they help him find his missing friend and rescue his dream?”  \n\nFor ages: 5+  \nFeatured on Discover until 30th April \nStays in your library and available on Yoto Space at any time",
